WEBVTT

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:05.770
Prepare thyselves!!

00:00:06.170 --> 00:00:08.690
Do you not see this license!?

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:11.070
Oh! You finally got it?

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:12.880
Good job, Hane!

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:13.990
Yay!

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:33.300
この坂を上り切ったら
kono saka o noborikittara

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:37.260
必ず見える景色が好きだって
kanarazu mieru keshiki ga suki datte

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:37.300
必ず見える景色が好きだって

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:43.430
背中に羽を持つあの子も言って笑ってた
senaka ni hane o motsu ano ko mo itte waratteta

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:47.110
ドキドキが一瞬で
dokidoki ga isshun de

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:51.190
トキメキになっていくんだなんて
tokimeki ni natteikunda nante

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:54.900
あの頃は信じられなくて
ano koro wa shinjirarenakute

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:59.870
ただ見惚れていたよ
tada mitoreteita yo

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:04.500
このスピードに乗せた体温が
kono supiido ni noseta taion ga

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.250
今全身で伝う　通じ合う
ima zenshin de tsutau tsuujiau

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:11.880
物語の鍵はこの手に
monogatari no kagi wa kono te ni

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:15.380
ぎゅっと強く握っているから
gyutto tsuyoku nigitteiru kara

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:19.100
感じて　応えて　風になる
kanjite kotaete kaze ni naru

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:22.770
空に溶けて海を抱きしめる
sora ni tokete umi o dakishimeru

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:26.690
新しい世界が見えるはず
atarashii sekai ga mieru hazu

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:33.780
さぁ確かめに行ってみよう
saa tashikame ni ittemiyou

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:44.660
Debut!!
Episode 3

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:47.790
Look, I bought a used bike magazine.

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:48.290
Debut!!
Episode 3

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:50.000
Ooh, you're itchin' to buy one?

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:53.630
I don't even know which one to get.

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:56.720
The most important thing is how it looks,

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:58.840
after that, the model year and mileage.

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:00.640
Are you gonna get it a second-hand bike?

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:02.930
My Katana was brand new.

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:06.180
You got yours when you were born

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:07.480
It's sixteen years old.

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:10.520
How about a 200CC Katana?

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.400
Isn't that your bike?

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:15.070
She just casually suggested the same bike as hers,

00:02:15.070 --> 00:02:17.700
but with a smaller engine displacement...

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:20.820
Beware the Katana drivers' obsession
with engine displacement.

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:23.490
What's wrong?

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:25.580
Can I just get a Super Four?

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:29.120
I've heard that the training
version is completely different.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:31.960
Super Four, huh?

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:33.380
Not that it's a bad thing,

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:34.880
rather, it's perfect for you.

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:35.760
Then...

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:37.880
But it's too perfect.

00:02:38.260 --> 00:02:38.970
Huh?

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:42.550
Bikes are meant to be
replaced every once and a while.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:46.220
But if you start with a Super Four,
you'll keep getting a Super Four.

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:49.440
They never get their large-motorcycle licenses.

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:52.770
And they end their biking lives
by never buying another bike.

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:55.360
Those who choose Super Fours

00:02:55.360 --> 00:03:00.280
are basically women who never
try to cheat on their man and stay faithful.

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:03.530
Isn't that a bad thing then?

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.490
I'm okay with my Katana.

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:08.580
Huh? Maybe I said that wrong?

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:09.500
Hey, look.

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:13.380
This shop has cheap Katanas and Super Fours.

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:15.250
Really? What's it called?

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:17.800
It's... Nicoichi Motors.

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:21.470
Y-You shouldn't go there...

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:22.340
Why is that?

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:26.140
Well, I bought my Serow there,

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:27.770
but it keeps breaking down.

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:31.230
You probably just got a bad one.

00:03:31.230 --> 00:03:33.190
You gotta know good from bad.

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:35.110
I-I guess.

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:37.150
Anyway, let's just go see it.

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:39.780
If it's actually bad, we can just go to another store.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:55.960
Here it is.

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:59.510
Wow, so many bikes!

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:02.130
But, they're all dirty.

00:04:02.130 --> 00:04:04.340
Doesn't even look like anyone
takes care of these.

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:09.390
They shouldn't have too many miles on them.

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:14.770
This Katana 250 is 16 years old,
but it has only 1800 miles on it.

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:17.320
But the frame needs work.

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:19.860
It's like they didn't love it, it's all rusted.

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:20.940
I see.

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:24.610
See? I told you this place is bad.

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:26.530
Let's just go somewhere else.

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:28.200
Okay? Okay?

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:29.330
H-Hey...

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:30.500
Hey, Onee-chan.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.410
Welcome back.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:35.580
"Onee-chan"?

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:39.000
Hey, looks like you're back, Onsa.

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:41.260
Since you're here, work on this.

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:44.180
Reset the meter like usual.

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:48.390
What's going on here, Shaggy?

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.720
Um...

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:56.770
This is my family's place.

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.560
What?!

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:02.240
It's not like I was trying to hide it.

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:05.660
But as you can see, it's
clearly not the best bike shop.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:13.450
Wow!

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:14.290
How could you tell?
Wow!

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:15.000
How could you tell?

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.920
Welp, you got me!

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:19.540
How could you tell the cylinders were broken?

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:21.210
You've got good eyes.

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:27.130
My Serow's made out of two Serows.

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:29.890
What? You can do that?

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:31.560
Really, though...

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:39.650
Genetics are scary.

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:42.110
Thank goodness I don't take after my dad.

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:47.570
I guess I won't be buying my bike here.

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:54.700
Seriously, what's with this Katana?!

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:58.750
I found a dried-up crab and
seaweed in the muffler.

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:01.710
Well, that one drowned.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:04.050
All your bikes are broken!

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:07.260
No wonder nobody likes your store.

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:10.800
I can't let Hane get a bike here.

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:13.930
This is why I said we shouldn't come.

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:15.850
Don't pick on our sister!

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:17.600
You're mean!

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:20.150
A pink Super Four...

00:06:23.230 --> 00:06:24.860
OMG
so
cute
--
--
It's
all
pink

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:27.280
You thought you could get
away with selling bikes like these?

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:28.490
I know!

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:29.700
I know.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:33.280
I know we're an awful bike shop.

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:36.500
But my siblings and I have
gotten by for this long

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:39.250
by selling bikes with reset
odometers for cheap!

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.880
Didn't you come here because
we sell for cheap, too?

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:47.300
That's what some customers want.

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:49.380
But, but...

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:53.050
I wanted Hane, at least, to have a decent bike.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:56.640
Onsa-chan, I've made up my mind.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.850
I'll buy this bike.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:02.560
This pink Super Four!

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:04.770
Hane, are you out of your mind?

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:06.570
Why? I'm being serious.

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:08.240
You can't...

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:09.780
You can't.

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:13.410
Hane, you can't buy a bike here.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:17.330
There are better shops to buy from.

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:17.830
So...

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.080
Onsa-chan,

00:07:19.620 --> 00:07:23.250
I'm not like you guys.
I don't know what's good or bad,

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:26.170
or what shops are good.

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:30.090
But I believe you when you
say a bike is good, Onsa-chan.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:33.010
That's why I'm going to buy a bike here.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:35.680
Hane...

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:38.350
No! Absolutely not!

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:41.600
I won't let you buy a bike here—

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:43.520
That sound...

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:46.980
Hey, Suzunoki. Long time no see.

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:48.070
D-Dad!

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:50.320
Have you got any good drowned bikes?

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:51.490
Oh, yeah.

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:53.950
Speaking of which, what happened to that

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:56.030
drowned Katana 400 you
bought a long time ago?

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:58.910
Oh, my daughter's riding that now.

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:01.410
She thinks it's brand new, though,

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:04.130
since the odometer's been reset.

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.000
Well, later!

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:16.800
Go on, Hane. Buy that Super Four.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:18.180
Have you made up your mind?

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:19.970
Let's reset the odometer, then.

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:20.770
No!

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:23.390
Onsa-chan...

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:27.400
Don't worry, Hane. I won't
let Dad mess with you!

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:30.070
<i>I'll</i> do all the service on your bike!

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:32.280
Okay.

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:34.450
Thanks, Onsa-chan!

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:41.620
Dad says I can buy it.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:43.960
A 36-month loan, huh?

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:46.040
It'll take until you graduate.

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:48.250
Okay, time to stamp it!

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:51.420
Wait, Onee-chan, you should read
the fine print before you—

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:02.560
Working for free in the name of trust...

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:05.690
I'm such a cheap woman.

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:13.990
Used, huh?

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:17.570
I wouldn't have let you buy such
a bike if I'd been with you.

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:18.870
It's fine!

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:22.200
I like this pink Super Four.

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:24.620
Hane, here's a free gift.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.540
A pink helmet!

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:28.830
Thanks!

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:29.540
Here.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:33.460
To be honest, I'm grateful to you.

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:36.590
You didn't really care about bikes,

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:40.510
but I made you get a license,
and even got you to buy a bike.

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:44.600
This is one of the proudest moments of my life.

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:47.480
Aww, it's too early to say that.

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:48.690
I mean...

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:10.790
Oh, right, Hane...

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:21.010
Whoa.

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:23.890
Is it just me, or was she going insanely fast?

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:25.100
How bad.

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:27.850
This is just a hint,

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:30.810
but maybe she shouldn't be allowed on that thing.

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:32.520
Yeah.

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:38.150
Yeah, I don't know yet.

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:40.700
Because it's all

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:45.910
just beginning.

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:50.710
I wonder if she knows

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:54.130
that there's not a lot of gas.

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:01.640
I'm out of gas...

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:08.850
Ba
kuon<i>!!</i>

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.870
This feels great!

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:24.580
The sky's clear.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:26.330
It's the perfect day for touring.

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:27.620
It sure is!

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:29.750
It would've been nice if Rin-chan came with us.

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:32.420
Yeah, but the way she was acting...

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:35.420
What? Touring?

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:38.920
Motorcycles are solitary vehicles.

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:41.260
There's no way I'd bike in a group.

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:42.640
That's so stupid.

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:43.800
Hold it, Rin.

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:45.600
What, got a problem?

00:11:45.600 --> 00:11:48.140
First, you haven't joined the club yet,

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:50.180
so I never invited you in the first place.

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:51.270
What'd you say?

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:53.940
You wouldn't invite your biker classmate?

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:55.560
Well, either way, you won't come.

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:56.820
That's right!

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:58.230
Then why do you care?

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:00.030
That's not the point!

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:01.900
Hijiri-chan, what's that?

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:04.700
It's a wireless headset.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:08.290
With these, we can talk while we ride.

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:09.870
Forget it.

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:12.870
I won't go with you, even if you ask.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:16.840
As I said, I never invited you.

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:18.170
Oh, my.

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:20.970
Hijiri, what's that?

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:22.510
It's an earphone.

00:12:22.510 --> 00:12:27.140
She won't be able to hear us without it.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:37.400
Hey, why is everyone giving us the peace sign?

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:41.860
They're asking, "Hey, girls,
how about for 20,000?"

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:44.700
So this is how you respond:

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:47.370
"I'll go for 50,000!"

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:52.000
But what are they paying you for?

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:53.910
W-Well...

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:56.000
A fun chat, or something?

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:59.000
I'm glad we put the headsets in.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:01.420
Indeed, this is quite enjoyable.

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:05.630
Hey, have you been getting interference?

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:07.340
I keep hearing someone else's voice...

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:10.760
Katana, Katana, Katana...

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:14.770
When I'm riding a Katana...

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:18.310
My head, my head, my head...

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:18.730
My head feels funny...

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:20.690
That voice... is that Rin?

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:20.900
My head feels funny...

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:22.940
It seems she's nearby.

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:23.650
Katana, Katana, Katana...
It seems she's nearby.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:26.070
I didn't get a chance to install earphones,
though, so she can't hear us.
Katana, Katana, Katana...

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:26.410
I didn't get a chance to install earphones,
though, so she can't hear us.

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:27.160
When I'm riding a Katana...
I didn't get a chance to install earphones,
though, so she can't hear us.

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.160
What?!
When I'm riding a Katana...

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:29.990
So we can't make her stop
singing this lame song?
When I'm riding a Katana...

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:30.580
So we can't make her stop
singing this lame song?

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:32.330
Hey, I see Frizzy's bike.

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:37.370
She doesn't even know I'm right behind her.

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:37.540
Yes, I do!
She doesn't even know I'm right behind her.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:38.710
Dummy.
Yes, I do!

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:41.250
Why's she flashing her lights at me?

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:44.210
Fire the missiles at Frizzy's Serow!

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:45.170
Pew, pew!

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:46.970
Rat-a-tat-tat!

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:47.340
Serow down!

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:48.550
Could she be any more embarrassing?
Serow down!

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:49.850
Could she be any more embarrassing?

00:13:49.850 --> 00:13:51.510
Awesome, Rin-chan!

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:53.850
She's going to make us die of laughter!

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:57.190
Get out of range of Rin's radio, guys!

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:09.320
My, what a coincidence, seeing you here.

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:11.740
So you're gonna play dumb?

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:14.080
Wh-What do you mean, "playing dumb"?

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:17.330
I really just happen to be
here for another gathering.

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:18.500
A gathering?

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:20.670
Oh, yeah, I saw them.

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:22.000
See?

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:25.210
There's a Katana 250 meeting there,

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:27.930
and a large Katana meeting here.

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:29.430
Which one are you going to?

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:34.680
She's joining the large Katanas?

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:35.770
Show-off.

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:37.350
U-Um.

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:40.690
There are two things that I can't accept.

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:42.770
The first is killing another man.

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:46.690
The second is being next to a smaller Katana.

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:51.450
She got left behind.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:52.200
Oh?

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:55.450
Now those gentlemen over
there are approaching her.

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:57.750
Nice, a Katana 400.

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:00.170
Whoa, she has a double front brake!

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:00.750
Huh?

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:04.130
400s need inspections, though.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:08.130
Yeah, I had to get a 250 because
I didn't have the money for those.

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:10.930
Some people think it's a
large-size, though, right?

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:11.970
Yeah!

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:15.180
That's the best feeling in the world!

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:17.100
Losers!

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:25.230
Yum.

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:27.610
Tofu ice cream is delicious.

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:34.320
Hane! What was that for?

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:36.450
Hey, can you hear me?

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:37.790
Shaggy?

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.210
We're taking a souvenir photo. Get over here.

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:44.920
A headset...

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:47.920
You had this the whole time you were riding?

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:50.260
What's wrong? Say something.

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:52.550
I'm not going. I don't want a photo.

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:55.390
Rin-chan, I know the truth.

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:56.350
What truth?

00:15:56.810 --> 00:16:00.100
You're a genuine girl when

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:02.440
you're wearing your helmet.

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:04.650
Indeed.

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:08.280
You were so genuine, you were
singing your Katana song.

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:09.030
Wha—

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:10.650
Don't tell me there's one in my helmet, too!

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:11.610
Yeah.

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:14.320
We heard your missile launch, too.

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:17.330
Come on, Rin.

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:24.120
The Katana gets center stage.

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:24.830
What?

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:28.630
You guys have to surround me and my Katana

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:30.760
and make us look good.

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:34.260
Jeez. You make so many demands.

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:37.430
Fine. Just get over here.

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:44.560
Bikes?

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:49.270
Yes, some of my students ride bikes to school.

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:52.690
We don't have a rule against
riding bikes to school.

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:55.450
Minowa-san from Class 1-B

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:57.620
is the heir to the Minowa Group.

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:00.700
In middle school, she used to
ride in on a helicopter.

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:04.710
Well, I'm fine with that, but they're telling me

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:06.630
that they're in the Bike Club.

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:08.210
Bike Club?

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:09.500
Yes.

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:12.210
We don't have such a club, though, do we?

00:17:12.880 --> 00:17:15.760
Actually, we do, Saruyama-sensei.

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:16.300
What?

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:20.560
Or, to be precise, we used to.

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:27.600
You were there the whole time, weren't you,

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:29.060
Raimu-senpai?

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:32.150
What? The Bike Club's defunct?

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:35.320
As of twenty years ago? What does that mean?

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:37.820
I don't really know,

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:40.200
but someone from the student council told me

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:42.240
there's no such thing as a Bike Club here.

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:43.910
Then what about this club room?

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.420
Apparently, Raimu-senpai was just

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:48.420
using it because it was empty.

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:50.750
They said we have to vacate today, too.

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:52.880
Aw, man.

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:55.760
So the Bike Club was unofficial?

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:58.430
Too bad for you, Shaggy.

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:02.100
I was just about to join the
Bike Club for you, too.

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:02.760
Huh?

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:05.270
Let's go, Hane, Hijiri.

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:07.440
Go where?

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:11.900
We're starting our own  new Bike Club, of course.

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:14.400
One without the hassle of having
Shaggy, and that's pretty great.

00:18:16.030 --> 00:18:19.450
Rin-chan, let's start our new Bike Club here.

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:20.660
Okay?

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:24.830
We need at least four members.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:28.370
Sakura Hane, Minowa Hijiri,

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:31.170
Amano Onsa, Raimu...

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:35.460
Wait, does anyone know Raimu-senpai's full name?

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:36.550
I don't.

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:40.090
Is Raimu her last name or her first name?

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:44.680
I can't ask her today, since she's not here.

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:46.350
What should we do about our fourth member?

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:48.270
Oh, yeah! Rin!

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:50.940
Would you mind letting us use your name?

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:53.110
My name!? <i>Only</i> my name?!

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:59.780
You got a new helmet, Senpai.

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:06.330
Tazuka didn't make the preliminary, either.

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:08.870
I guess the only one of us Team Virgin

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:12.380
to make it to the finals is Raimu-senpai.

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:15.130
Raimu-senpai,

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:17.760
we'll do the maintenance.

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:21.340
You're an important rider for Team Virgin.

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:24.260
You should take it easy until the race begins.

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:28.230
We school-girl mechanics
will get the job done for you!

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:30.520
Just leave it all to us.

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:42.360
Last lap!

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.410
Raimu-senpai has the lead!

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:47.790
We worked really hard to
maintain that machine.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:50.210
Senpai can do it.

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:52.620
Huh, what's this?

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:54.380
That's a screw.

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:56.590
Oops, I guess I forgot to tighten it.

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:57.550
H-Hey!

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:08.970
It's on fire! It's on fire!

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:10.140
Raimu-senpai!

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:12.060
Senpai still has the lead!

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:14.100
She just needs to make it to the flag.

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:15.520
Raimu-senpai!

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:20.070
Off she goes!

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:23.280
I wouldn't say bikes are bad.

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:27.490
But the combination of schoolgirls and bikes is terrible.

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:31.620
If it hadn't been highschool girls
doing the servicing on that bike...

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:34.880
It's been twenty years.

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:37.040
I stopped biking.

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:39.590
I grew up.

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:42.760
No one can be a schoolgirl forever

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:45.090
the way you can, Raimu-senpai.

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:48.390
I can't approve of the Bike Club.

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:50.560
But...

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:55.310
If you promise to protect those girls

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:57.690
from all the dangers of biking...

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:57.810
----
------
It'll
be
fine.
from all the dangers of biking...

00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:59.570
It'll
be
fine.
----
------

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:04.820
Oh yeah, Senpai, I have
something nice for you.

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:08.240
It's probably what you want the most.

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:14.370
Hooray for the Bike Club's approval!

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:17.500
Hooray! Hooray! Hooray!

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:21.510
Don't forget, it's because I let you use my name.

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:25.970
But now that I've signed my name,
even if it's against my will, I guess I'll...

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:27.970
Oh, yeah, about that...

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:30.510
Now that we know Raimu-senpai's
class and full name,

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:32.310
I took your name off the list.

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:35.690
Oh, but if you do want to join...

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:40.480
I'd never join your club!

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:45.150
They're not coming after me?

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:47.570
Whoops.

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:53.410
I thought you were going to protect them.

00:21:54.700 --> 00:21:57.710
What? She's not a Bike Club member?

00:21:58.290 --> 00:21:59.420
I see.

00:22:09.090 --> 00:22:10.800
buon!  buon!  buon!  buon!  buoon!

